Portal Muse

Contains code ported to Kotlin, and test vectors copied, from muse-gadget-sdk
(https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk),
commit a5f809f621c4cbdbd37336fe17e7cdb74cebf3fe.
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Ported files (modified: translated from Python and C to Kotlin, community pairing mode only):
core/src/main/kotlin and app/src/main/kotlin/com/portalmuse/gadget/BlePeripheral.kt.

app/src/main/cpp/muse_wakeword is a copy of the SDK's detector sources and "Hey Muse" model
(Apache License 2.0). Training data credits are in muse_wakeword/models/ATTRIBUTION.md.

The vectors core/src/test/resources/noise_wire_sdk.json and rtc_sdk.json are produced by the
SDK's Python code with the scripts in core/src/test/tools.

Some icons in app/src/main/res/drawable use paths from Google's Material Icons
(Apache License 2.0).

Downloaded by tools/prepare-wakeword.sh and not included: ExecuTorch (BSD 3-Clause),
esp-nn (Apache 2.0), esp-micro-speech-features (Apache 2.0).

Weather data on the home screen comes from Open-Meteo.com.

